        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who said the job of a courier is easy? In the world of <strong>Delivery Up Together</strong>, even gravity tries to stop you. Your route goes through challenging and unique sections—from steep mountain slopes to unstable constructions in the sky. Every 1000 m you’re greeted by a hungry NPC client: deliver the food, save at the checkpoint, and climb higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The main rule</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The backpack is your life. Touch any surface with it twice—and it will fall off; you’ll have to climb back down, otherwise the path to the next level will be blocked. Decide whether to take the risk and push forward, or return for your precious cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Switch to the moped</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need speed? Switch to your moped at any moment to quickly pass dangerous sections. But be careful: controlling a vehicle in the air is even harder than on foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical challenge</strong>: a game for those who love Only Up–style trials—constant upward movement where every mistake sends you back. Jump, climb, and balance through a 3D environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6099ca6a7cb17a0030bea6630562c985.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6099ca6a7cb17a0030bea6630562c985.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6099ca6a7cb17a0030bea6630562c985.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backpack mechanic</strong>: two hits—and the order flies down. You’ll need to go retrieve it, otherwise the delivery won’t happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6632b48b50e240471a5b9dc0b6b9dbba.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6632b48b50e240471a5b9dc0b6b9dbba.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6632b48b50e240471a5b9dc0b6b9dbba.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive gameplay</strong>: moving platforms, traps, rotating objects, physics-based elements, and even labyrinths you'll have to overcome on your way up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fe9a9555d21367fc64c8a063a429b180.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fe9a9555d21367fc64c8a063a429b180.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fe9a9555d21367fc64c8a063a429b180.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moped</strong>: instantly switch to your vehicle for quick maneuvers or long jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/9a118a842bbaac0cff6aeaf5f540046b.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/9a118a842bbaac0cff6aeaf5f540046b.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/9a118a842bbaac0cff6aeaf5f540046b.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoint clients</strong>: hand the food to NPCs and save your progress to restart from a new level after a fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/75b2db879eb5df84a8c73c290da9ff5e.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/75b2db879eb5df84a8c73c290da9ff5e.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/75b2db879eb5df84a8c73c290da9ff5e.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time capsules</strong>: collect special capsules to rewind time and fix mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/f349be9442469270323d8982d01986da.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/f349be9442469270323d8982d01986da.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/f349be9442469270323d8982d01986da.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op for up to 4 players</strong>: play with friends and compete to see who reaches the finish first. You can progress carefully side by side or create chaos by pushing each other off the route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fbbfdbd0b95c9a2f837dbc444a605b5a.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fbbfdbd0b95c9a2f837dbc444a605b5a.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fbbfdbd0b95c9a2f837dbc444a605b5a.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character switching</strong>: choose the courier that suits you best and change your appearance anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/cb8dffdd58128890354712d06e6e0f75.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/cb8dffdd58128890354712d06e6e0f75.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/cb8dffdd58128890354712d06e6e0f75.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your playstyle</strong>: from trainee mode with frequent saves and unlimited time capsules to “express delivery” with no room for mistakes. Suitable both for casual runs and speedruns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for heights where every meter has a price, and every order has its destiny. Take on the challenge of <strong>Delivery Up Together</strong> and prove that the best way to a client's heart lies through the clouds!</p>",
